@startuml
!include _seq-style.puml
title 3.1.3 Logout

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
boundary "App Shell / Menu" as UI <<boundary>>

== Logout ==
U -> UI: tap Logout
activate UI
UI -> UI: clear JWT & local session data
note right of UI
  JWT stateless backend:
  no revoke API in current codebase
end note
UI --> U: navigate to Login
deactivate UI

@enduml
